<<~ ahu #examples >>

!! Examples

Minimal inline edges:

```text
<<~ pranala ? -> lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/mu#entry family:relation >>
```

```text
<<~ pranala lar:///A#out -> lar:///B#in family:relation >>
```

